Package: gsm.vizr
Title: R Wrappers for the gsm.viz Generic and KRI Chart Renderers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michal", "Kaminski", , "michkam89@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0850-9939")),
    person("Gilead Sciences", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: An htmlwidgets interface to the gsm.viz JavaScript library,
    hosting both of its chart generations. For the generic bars and facetBars
    renderers it provides spec construction and validation, a stable
    R-to-JavaScript serialization contract, click and selection events, Shiny
    bindings with proxy update verbs, and a shared HTML dependency for other
    packages custom widgets. It also hosts the legacy Key Risk Indicator
    widget wrappers, their Shiny bindings, and the widget controls they share.
